**10. Functions of the Chief Executive Officer.** —( _1_ ) The Chief Executive Officer shall be the legal representative of the Food Authority and shall be responsible for-

( _a_ ) the day-to-day administration of the Food Authority;

( _b_ ) drawing up of proposal for the Food Authority's work programmes in consultation with the Central Advisory Committee;

